'''Lake Andrasha''' was a [[Water|lake]] on the [[Core Worlds|Core World]] [[planet]] of [[Chandrila]].<ref name="Life Debt" /> In [[5 ABY]],<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of ''[[Aftermath: Life Debt]]'' to [[5 ABY]].</ref> the [[Special Senator Council on Galactic De-Escalation Strategies]], a subgroup of the [[New Republic Senate|legislature]] of the [[New Republic]], was transported by former [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] [[Rebel pilot|pilot]] [[Norra Wexley]] to the lake, where a meeting was held. When the Republic's [[Captain]] [[Wedge Antilles]] visited Wexley on Chandrila, she mentioned bringing the [[senator]]s to Lake Andrasha.<ref name="Life Debt" />

==Behind the scenes==
Lake Andrasha was mentioned in ''[[Aftermath: Life Debt]]'', a [[2016]] novel written by [[Chuck Wendig]] as the second installment of ''[[Star Wars: The Aftermath Trilogy]]''.<ref name="Life Debt" />

